{"unit_id":"tag:04HZ:proof","translation":"这是因为茎（stalks）<MATH_0001>为局部（local）的，且<MATH_0002>有足够多的点（enough points），参见引理<REF_0001>、定理<REF_0002>及注记<REF_0003>。参见《景上的模（Modules on Sites）》引理<REF_0004>及<REF_0005>，其中说明这些事实意味着小（small）平展（<ACCENT_0001>tale）景（site）局部赋环（locally ringed）。\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"stalks","target_term":"茎"},{"source_term":"local","target_term":"局部"},{"source_term":"enough points","target_term":"足够多的点"},{"source_term":"Modules on Sites","target_term":"景上的模"},{"source_term":"small","target_term":"小"},{"source_term":"étale","target_term":"平展"},{"source_term":"site","target_term":"景"},{"source_term":"locally ringed","target_term":"局部赋环"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"stalks","target_term":"茎","context":"层的茎。"},{"source_term":"local","target_term":"局部","context":"局部环。"},{"source_term":"enough points","target_term":"足够多的点","context":"景的足够点性质。"},{"source_term":"Modules on Sites","target_term":"景上的模","context":"引用章节。"},{"source_term":"small","target_term":"小","context":"景的大小。"},{"source_term":"étale","target_term":"平展","context":"暂定译法。"},{"source_term":"site","target_term":"景","context":"暂定译法。"},{"source_term":"locally ringed","target_term":"局部赋环","context":"景的局部赋环性质。"}],"notes":[]}
